<p>You extend your tentacle to grab a distant target, pulling it to you.</p><p>As long as Constrict stays active the target is bound by your tentacle, it can try to move away but each turn you pull it back in 1 tile.</p><p>While constricting you cannot use your tentacle to enhance your normal attacks but you deal <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">126%, 137%, 146%, 153%, 160%</acronym> tentacle damage each turn to your target.</p><p>Enemies can resist the attempt to pull them but Constrict will always work for purposes of modifying your talents.</p><p>Your other tentacle talents may act differently when used while constricting (check their descriptions).</p>